chem-wasm: third-party notices

Datagrok Chem's Crux engine (feature set chem): RDKit.js's API (parsing, writers,
substructure, fingerprints, depiction, drawing; MCS, R-groups, reactions, standardization,
CoordGen), fast search, descriptors and the scaffold tree, as the feature set holds.
This WebAssembly module is Rust code of crux-core (https://github.com/datagrok-ai/crux-core), ported
from the software below or embedding it. Each part names what the module holds of it and
reproduces its licence. Written by crux-core's tools/wasm_notices.py from the crates this
build links (its name section), their licence files and the pinned RDKit wheel.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RDKit 2026.03.6 (https://github.com/rdkit/rdkit, tag Release_2026_03_6)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BSD 3-Clause License. Ported to Rust file for file (each file names its RDKit sources):
  crux-core crates cip-labeler, crux-wasm, depictor, distgeom, forcefield, moldraw2d, molfile, molstandardize, rk, rxn, scaffold-network, smarts-parser, smi-compiler.
