------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FreeType 2.9.1 (https://freetype.org), the glyph outlines and metrics
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The FreeType License (FTL). moldraw2d's ft.rs ports the parts of FreeType 2.9.1 RDKit's
text drawing calls (FT_Outline_Decompose, FT_Outline_Get_BBox, FT_MulDiv, the unscaled
TrueType glyph loading, the Unicode charmap choice):

  Portions of this software are copyright © 2018 The FreeType Project
  (www.freetype.org). All rights reserved.

The FTL's text is FreeType's docs/FTL.TXT (tag VER-2-9-1).

