Roboto (Google), a drawing font
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Apache License 2.0. The module embeds moldraw2d's fonts/Roboto-Regular.ttf, RDKit's built-in
Roboto Regular (`BuiltinRobotoRegular`). The file below is moldraw2d's fonts/Roboto-Apache-2.0.txt.

Roboto Regular (Roboto-Regular.ttf), Version 2.137; 2017.
Copyright 2011 Google Inc. All Rights Reserved. Roboto is a trademark of Google.

The file is RDKit's built-in BuiltinRobotoRegular face, byte for byte: the bytes of
Code/GraphMol/MolDraw2D/Fonts/roboto_regular.h at RDKit Release_2026_03_6 (a dump of
$RDBASE/Data/Fonts/Roboto-Regular.ttf made by Data/Fonts/font_dumper.py). RDKit's
Data/Fonts/roboto_regular_license.txt says: "The Roboto-Regular font is license with
Apache 2.0. https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0". It is not modified here.

